      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Sensação. Os chifres na cabeça de Ralts possuem um grande poder e permitem que ele perceba as emoções das pessoas. Este Pokémon é muito sensível aos sentimentos de humanos e Pokémon, e se esconde quando detecta hostilidade.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/4</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Ralts pode evoluir para Kirlia no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Disarming Voice, Double Team, Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Teleport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Lucky Chant</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Magical Leaf, Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Heal Pulse, Life Dew</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Calm Mind, Draining Kiss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Future Sight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Charm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Dream Eater, Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Stored Power</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Alluring Voice, Ally Switch, Attract, Body Slam, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Confuse Ray, Dazzling Gleam, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Encore, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Frustration, Future Sight, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Imprison, Knock Off, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Magical Leaf, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Metronome, Misty Terrain, Pain Split, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Will-O-Wisp, Wonder Room, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ally Switch, Confuse Ray, Destiny Bond, Disable, Encore, Grudge, Knock Off, Mean Look, Memento, Misty Terrain, Mystical Fire, Shadow Sneak, Skill Swap, Synchronoise</p>",
